        "TileImage": "$($repository 5a3a3205-75d6-4cd9-b397-fee70e878601).Image",
        "Description": "Another batch of goons. \r\rThis group is considerably more dangerous than the last, be careful 47bala. \r\rVeggie Elder has returned from the grave and is causing pandemonium from the kitchen, serving cold soup to everyone at the function. A rival pair of  twitch streamers found outside the mansion has been sapping views from Flyann, and their sneaky butler is communicating with them from the second floor. \r\rWe&apos;ve prepared a helicopter escape for your extraction.\r\rGood luck, 47bala.",
